    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Every spot inside the scene is the fork's generated layout, not an original one. Zone number 1242 is the fork's; ours must be assigned and the scene sg_random_encounter_02 has not been loaded by our server yet (the eleven shipped battles all use sg_random_encounter_clearing). Triggers: at-start spawns are actors, later waves follow the one before (the fork's 1.5 s delay is dropped). Knockouts and score are the design's defaults; coins and XP are the shipped battles' values, not the fork's 15 coins / 100 stars."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Not proven in the client: this scene needs one native load, and the starter or door of `entry` is drawn by the entrances work, not by this file. Each kind's rank here decides its health and hit at the fight's tier."
    },
    {"kind": "wiki", "evidence": "L1194 (owner 2026-11-12: the end-of-battle prize wheel depends on the player's class): the wheel is this battle's own fanbyte page 'Thugawug Bumbler! (FR Battle)' (Prize Wheel Rewards, one list per class plus its General Purpose part; cached lab/references/fanbyte-battles-20261112/Thugawug_Bumbler_FR_Battle.html). Each class's wheel holds its own items and the shared items; the coins are the page's. It replaces every earlier note in this record about the prize wheel or its prizes."}
